Yet a seamstress named Mira hoarded quiet resolve, counting each thread as a plan. The quay grew quiet, ships drifted, and the chorus dimmed. The Council summoned a Ceremony of Honest Return, where every gift, debt, and pledge rose into view, exposing hidden costs and restoring trust. When the lantern path brightened again, Emberhaven breathed wide and steadfast, for prosperity travels best when truth guides the current and every giver trusts the return they’ve seeded.
